flowchart TD
 M[Measure frame time battery memory] --> F{Frame budget exceeded?}
 F -- yes --> Q[Lower decode quality]
 Q --> P{Still over budget?}
 P -- yes --> C[Reduce prefetch and evict LRU]
 P -- no --> S[Apply at frame boundary]
 F -- no --> B{Battery low?}
 B -- yes --> R[Reduce prefetch/cache]
 B -- no --> G[Small cautious prefetch increase]
 C --> S
 R --> S
 G --> S
 S --> M
